
{
  "uid": "spacedock-profiling",
  "title": "SpaceDock - Continuous Profiling",
  "tags": [
    "spacedock",
    "pyroscope",
    "profiling",
    "performance"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Pyroscope Availability",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"pyroscope\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Pyroscope",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Backend CPU Usage",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{service_name=\"spacedock.backend\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Backend CPU cores",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Backend Memory Usage",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{service_name=\"spacedock.backend\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Backend RSS",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Celery Memory Usage",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{service_name=\"spacedock.celery\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Celery RSS",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Backend CPU Profile",
      "type": "flamegraph",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource",
        "uid": "pyroscope"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "service_name=\"spacedock.backend\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Celery CPU Profile",
      "type": "flamegraph",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource",
        "uid": "pyroscope"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "service_name=\"spacedock.celery\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Profiling Investigation",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Performance investigation\n\nOpen **Explore → Pyroscope** to investigate application profiles.\n\nRecommended investigations:\n\n- CPU hotspots in Flask request handlers.\n- Expensive database operations.\n- Celery task execution overhead.\n- Memory allocation hotspots.\n- Unexpected CPU consumption.\n\nCompare profiles before and after performance optimizations."
      }
    }
  ]
}
